    <dependencies>
      <dependency task="135" status="pending">Named by the orchestrator as a prerequisite (session-27 batch); expected to supply CIAM-plane veto parity so the grantor's level on the CIAM plane honours Restricted / Secure / deny. Re-derive from its POML.</dependency>
      <dependency task="136" status="pending">Named by the orchestrator as a prerequisite (session-27 batch); expected to make external read gates rights-based so a None-rights key can never read as a grantable root. Re-derive from its POML.</dependency>
