      <dependency task="141" status="pending">C7: workforce identity binding by Entra oid. This route admits a WORKFORCE contact-only principal as a grantor, and today that principal can be resolved from an unverified email claim matched against contact.emailaddress1. That is the hijack path in session 27's C7 research and in task 013's background (WorkforcePrincipalResolver.cs:153-202 → IdentityNormalizationService.cs:242-303). Without 141, anyone whose token carries a matching email could MINT grants as that contact. This escalates an existing read-side defect into an access-minting one.</dependency>
